lisa-design:
- ci-image.yml checks out this repo at job.workflow_sha at the workspace root (cmd/release, cmd/image-scan) and the caller under caller/, so the tools never end up in the caller's build context.
- VERSION comes from a new `release build-version` (release.BuildVersion): preview's pr-<n>-<sha7>/main-<sha7> form, but without preview's label/fork conditions (PreviewVersion returns "" then).
- image-scan check scans the local image (Scanner.Pull false), OSV online (no DB cache in CI), every finding to the summary (actionable first, capped at 1000 rows), exit 1 on any actionable finding. No diff against :main by design.
- image job: contents: read only (the gha layer cache needs no actions permission), closed-PR guard, not in required's needs; TestRequiredNeedsEveryJob now excludes image.
- ci-action.yml passes images built with format() from its dockerfile/context inputs (agent-action's container is built by the runner on each use).

